---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Insights | CtrlBuild Technologies"
  description="Ideas, perspectives and practical insights from CtrlBuild Technologies on software engineering, digital systems, AI and technology."
>
  <main class="cb-insights-page">
    <section class="cb-insights-hero">
      <div class="cb-container">
        <p class="cb-eyebrow">/ INSIGHTS</p>

        <h1>
          Thinking about
          <span>technology.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="cb-insights-hero__intro">
          Practical perspectives on software, digital systems, artificial
          intelligence and the technology behind better ways of working.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cb-insights-content">
      <div class="cb-container">
        <div class="cb-insights-content__header">
          <div>
            <p class="cb-eyebrow">/ COMING SOON</p>

            <h2>
              Useful ideas are
              <span>on the way.</span>
            </h2>
          </div>

          <p>
            We are preparing articles and practical guides covering the
            technology decisions, engineering principles and digital
            challenges that businesses encounter every day.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="cb-insights-topics">
          <article class="cb-insight-topic">
            <span class="cb-insight-topic__number">01</span>

            <div>
              <p class="cb-eyebrow">ENGINEERING</p>
              <h3>Building better software systems</h3>
              <p>
                Architecture, development practices, scalability and the
                engineering decisions behind reliable digital products.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="cb-insight-topic">
            <span class="cb-insight-topic__number">02</span>

            <div>
              <p class="cb-eyebrow">DIGITAL SYSTEMS</p>
              <h3>Technology for better operations</h3>
              <p>
                How organisations can replace fragmented processes with
                connected systems, automation and useful information.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="cb-insight-topic">
            <span class="cb-insight-topic__number">03</span>

            <div>
              <p class="cb-eyebrow">AI & DATA</p>
              <h3>Making intelligent technology practical</h3>
              <p>
                Practical applications of AI, data and automation that solve
                real problems rather than simply adding technology for its own
                sake.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="cb-insight-topic">
            <span class="cb-insight-topic__number">04</span>

            <div>
              <p class="cb-eyebrow">PRODUCT</p>
              <h3>From idea to digital product</h3>
              <p>
                Lessons around product discovery, MVP development, technical
                foundations and building products that can grow.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cb-insights-cta">
      <div class="cb-container">
        <div class="cb-insights-cta__panel">
          <p class="cb-eyebrow">/ HAVE SOMETHING TO BUILD?</p>

          <h2>
            You don't have to
            <span>wait.</span>
          </h2>

          <p>
            Our insights are coming soon, but your project does not have to.
            Tell us what you are trying to build or improve.
          </p>

          <a href="/contact/">
            Start a conversation
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .cb-insights-hero {
    padding: 9rem 0 7rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .cb-insights-hero h1 {
    max-width: 10ch;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    line-height: 0.94;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
  }

  .cb-insights-hero h1 span,
  .cb-insights-content__header h2 span,
  .cb-insights-cta__panel h2 span {
    color: var(--color-brand-coral);
  }

  .cb-insights-hero__intro {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .cb-insights-content {
    padding: 7rem 0 2rem;
  }

  .cb-insights-content__header {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .cb-insights-content__header h2 {
    max-width: 11ch;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    line-height: 0.97;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  .cb-insights-content__header > p {
    max-width: 34rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .cb-insights-topics {
    display: grid;
  }

  .cb-insight-topic {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 3.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .cb-insight-topic__number {
    padding-top: 0.2rem;
    color: var(--color-brand-coral);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cb-insight-topic h3 {
    max-width: 20ch;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .cb-insight-topic p:not(.cb-eyebrow) {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .cb-insights-cta {
    padding: 7rem 0 8rem;
  }

  .cb-insights-cta__panel {
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
  }

  .cb-insights-cta__panel h2 {
    max-width: 10ch;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    line-height: 0.97;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  .cb-insights-cta__panel > p:not(.cb-eyebrow) {
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .cb-insights-cta__panel a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-brand-coral);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cb-insights-cta__panel a span {
    transition: transform 180ms ease;
  }

  .cb-insights-cta__panel a:hover span {
    transform: translate(3px, -3px);
  }

  @media (min-width: 700px) {
    .cb-insights-hero {
      padding: 11rem 0 8rem;
    }

    .cb-insights-content {
      padding-top: 9rem;
    }

    .cb-insights-content__header {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
      align-items: end;
      gap: 5rem;
      padding-bottom: 6rem;
    }

    .cb-insight-topic {
      grid-template-columns: 5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
      padding: 5rem 0;
    }

    .cb-insights-cta__panel {
      padding: 6rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .cb-insights-hero {
      padding: 7rem 0 5rem;
    }

    .cb-insights-content {
      padding-top: 6rem;
    }

    .cb-insights-cta {
      padding: 6rem 0;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .cb-insights-cta__panel a span {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
